      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Sa follows the key",
      "body": "In Unit 1 you moved Sa around. Now you know why: Sa is always the tonic. In G major, Sa is G, Re is A, Ga is B, and so on. The shuddha notes Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Dha Ni follow exactly the major scale formula.\n\n**Why it matters:** if you think in sargam, you already know every major scale. Set Sa to the tonic and sing.",
